  <h2>What that means</h2>
  <p>
    Buttons that say "Check price on Amazon" are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something on Amazon within the
    time window Amazon allows, Amazon pays us a small percentage of the sale. You pay the same price you would anyway.
  </p>

  <h2>What it doesn't change</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We recommend gear because it suits the job in the post, not because of the commission.</li>
    <li>No brand pays to be included or to get a Made in USA stamp.</li>
    <li>We don't show Amazon prices or star ratings on this site, because they change constantly. Click through to see the current price.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>If anything here isn't clear, <a href="/contact/">ask us</a>.</p>
